# High Command Decree: Annexation of Widemos
DISPATCH HCP-820-001
ENCRYPTION: TYRANN-CIPHER-7
ORIGIN: High-Command-Tyrann / Citadel-Prime
TARGET: Sector-Governors-All
STARDATE: 820-G.E.114
PRIORITY: FLASH-URGENT
STATUS: BROADCAST
PAYLOAD:
  EVENT: "The Rancher of Widemos has been condemned and executed under Article 14 for anti-Khanate treason."
  INTEL: "Widemos livestock ranches and starports placed under immediate Tyranni imperial receivership."
  DIRECTIVE: "All border patrols must detain the student heir Biron Farrill upon arrival from Earth."
  WARNING: "Sympathizers of Widemos will face summary planetary bombardment."
AUTHENTICATION: SIG-KHANATE-MIL-7701-ALPHA
END_DISPATCH
